      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 226\n",
        "Survival Area"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route226_Text_SignRt227Rt228",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 227\n",
        "Rt. 228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route226_Text_SovereignFireMasterIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m the Fire-type Master!\n",
        "I aim to find the ultimate Fire-type!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route226_Text_SovereignFireMasterFail",
      "en_US": [
        "Come at me with only a {COLOR 1}single Pokémon{COLOR 0}\n",
        "in your party if you want to battle me.\r",
        "Oh, and there’s one other condition...\n",
        "That Pokémon must be a {COLOR 1}Fire-type{COLOR 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route226_Text_SovereignFireMasterAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Fire-type looks pretty strong!\r",
        "Should we find out who has the\n",
        "ultimate Fire-type Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route226_Text_SovereignFireMasterBattle",
      "en_US": "Time for a Fire-type battle!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route226_Text_SovereignFireMasterWin",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, wow.\r",
        "It seems the ultimate Fire-type\n",
        "Pokémon belongs to you!\r",
        "That means you are the rightful owner\n",
        "of this precious item!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route226_Text_SovereignFireMasterLose",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you for a great Fire-type\n",
        "Pokémon battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route226_Text_SovereignFireMasterThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you for a great Fire-type\n",
        "Pokémon battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route226_Text_SovereignFireMasterDecline",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm...\n",
        "Do you feel like you can’t win?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route226_Text_SovereignWyverIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, challenger.\n",
        "I am Wyver of the Battle Zone.\r",
        "Hard training with Dragon-type Pokémon\n",
        "allows me to endure any heat.\r",
        "Did you want to challenge me for the\n",
        "unofficial {COLOR 1}Fang Badge{COLOR 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route226_Text_SovereignWyverBattle",
      "en_US": "Show me the tenacity of your Pokémon.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route226_Text_SovereignWyverReward",
      "en_US": [
        "Impressive. Your Pokémon are strong.\n",
        "Here you go.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route226_Text_SovereignWyverReceived",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Fang Badge from Wyver!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route226_Text_SovereignWyverExplain",
      "en_US": [
        "That Fang Badge...\n",
        "It’s totally useless, really."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route226_Text_SovereignWyverThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "Wyver: Dragon-type Pokémon are hard\n",
        "to train, but can be very rewarding."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
